onsistent with statement 21, but since Bob is rough, the condition in 21 isn't met, so it doesn't affect anything.\n\nSo yes, Bob is green, so the statement is false.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Bob is not green\" is false because Bob is green based on the given logical deductions.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
