ing anything.Let\'s go through each relevant point again.\n\nHarry is young (10).Young people are white (12), so Harry is white.Then, since Harry is young and white, per point 17, he must be big.So yes, Harry is big.Harry is old, so he\'s black (12). Being old and black, he\'s small (17).. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
