 is not quiet" would be false.So, the answer would be B) False.\n\nBut let me double-check to make sure I\'m not missing anything.\n\nLooking at fact 9: Quiet, blue things are big.So, if something is quiet and blue, it\'s big.But Dave is big, but we don\'t know if he\'s blue.Let\'s check if Dave is blue.\n\nFrom fact 10: If something is blue, then it is young.Fact 12: Young things are blue.So, being blue and being young are connected.If something is blue, it\'s young, and if it\'s young, it\'s blue.Dave is not big, mean, loud, blue, green, or old.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
