 must be round.\n\nNow, since Dave is quiet and round, from point 17, if someone is quiet and round, they are red.So Dave must be red.\n\nWait, but Dave is green (point 4).So Dave is both green and red?That seems contradictory.Let me check the rules again.\n\nPoint 17 says if someone is quiet and round, then they are red.Dave is not nice.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
