t we don\'t know if Bob is furry.So that might not apply directly unless we can determine if Bob is furry.\n\nLet me check if there\'s any information about Bob\'s fur.The context doesn\'t mention Bob being furry or not.So we don\'t know that.\n\nBob is mean and loud, so he\'s not blue. Therefore, Bob is not blue.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
