rom Being Big:**\n   - Big people are young (rule 11). Therefore, Bob is young.\n\n5. **Inferences from Being Young and Cold:**\n   - Young, cold people are red (rule 14). Therefore, Bob is red.\n\n6. **Inferences from Being Red:**\n   - Red people are smart (rule 12). Therefore, Bob is smart.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
