.Let\'s go through the rules one by one.\n\nRule 11 says cold things are big.So if Gary is cold, he must be big.But in the context, it\'s stated that Gary is cold and nice.It doesn\'t mention whether Gary is big or not.However, according to rule 11, since he\'s cold, he must be big.So Gary is cold, nice, and big.\n\nNow, let\'s see if any other rules apply to Gary.Rule 10 says all cold, big things are red.Since Gary is cold and big (from rule 11), he must be red.Gary is not young.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
