ng anything because sometimes these logic problems can have hidden implications.\n\nLet me go through each rule to see if any of them could affect Erin\'s niceness.\n\nRule 17: All round people are nice.Erin is not nice according to the context, and all the rules contradict that. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
