mouse needs the cow (from \"If the cat needs the mouse then the mouse needs the cow\").\n\n3. **Conclusion:**\n   - Based on the above reasoning, the mouse does need the cow. Therefore, the statement \"The mouse does not need the cow\" is **False**.\n\n**Answer:** B) False",
