 Quietness:**\n   - Quietness is implied if someone is red and round (point 11). Since Erin is white, she can't be red, so she isn't quiet via this rule. There's no other rule making Erin quiet.\n\n5. **Conclusion:**\n   - Without knowing if Erin is round or quiet, we can't confirm the conditions in point 13. Thus, Erin's smartness remains unknown.\n\n**Answer:** C) Unknown",
