all the rules are satisfied, and Fiona is furry. Therefore, the statement \"Fiona is not furry\" is false. So the correct answer is B) False.\n\nWait, but earlier I thought Fiona is not furry, but according to rule 13, she is. So the statement is false, so the answer is B) False.\n\nI think that's correct. So the answer is B) False.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Fiona is not furry\" is false because Fiona is both round and red, making her furry according to rule 13. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n**B) False**",
