alse.\n\nWait, but according to fact 17, Bob must be young because he's cold and smart.So the contradiction arises because Bob can't be both young and not kind.\n\nTherefore, the only way to resolve this is that the statement is false because Bob can't be young without being kind, which he isn't.\n\nSo the answer is B) False.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Bob is young\" is false because, according to the given rules, if Bob were young, he would have to be kind, which he isn't. \n\n**Answer: B) False**",
