re quiet. So Bob is smart, so he's quiet.\n\nSo yes, Bob is quiet. Therefore, the answer is A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Bob is quiet\" is true based on the given rules. Since Bob is red, he is smart (rule 4). As a smart person, he must be quiet (rule 8). Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\nA) True\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
