reen (point 6) and kind (point 7).Are there any rules that could change this?.\n\nLooking at rule 14: If someone is kind and furry, then they are blue.Erin is kind, but is she furry?The given facts don\'t say Erin is furry.So, this rule doesn\'t apply to her because she\'s not furry.Therefore, Erin being kind doesn\'t necessarily make her blue unless she\'s also furry, which she isn\'t.\n\nRule 17: If someone is furry, then they are cold.Erin is definitely not kind.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
