and young people are rough, but that being nice and young makes you rough. So Bob, being nice and young, must be rough. Therefore, the statement that Bob is not rough is false.\n\nSo the answer should be B) False.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Bob is not rough\" is false because Bob is both nice and young, which according to the given rules, makes him rough.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
