k to make sure I didn\'t miss anything.Erin is not red, so round.That makes her mean.Mean people are foolish, so Erin is foolish.Therefore, the statement that Erin is not smart is true.\n\nI don\'t think there\'s any conflicting information here.All the premises lead to Erin being foolish\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
