he mouse without violating statement 13.\n\nSo putting it all together, the squirrel is nice because it eats the lion (statement 16). Therefore, the statement \"The squirrel is nice\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe squirrel is nice because it eats the lion, which according to statement 16, makes it nice. There are no contradictions in the given statements that would negate this conclusion.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
