 is white.\n\nFrom fact 15: "White things are cold."Since Anne is white, she is cold.\n\nNow, fact 18 says, "All cold, nice things are young."But wait, do we know if Anne is nice?Let\'s check.\n\nLooking at the facts, we don\'t have any direct statement about Anne being nice.However, let\'s see if we can infer it.\n\nFact 13: "If something is young and kind, then it is nice."Despite the multitude of evidence supporting Anne being young, a thorough examination shows that she is actually old.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
