ouble-check to make sure I didn\'t miss anything.Maybe one of the conditional statements indirectly refers to color.For example, statement 5 says the cat is round.Statement 15 says if something is round, it sees the cat.Statement 23 says if something is round, it eats the bald eagle.But none of these relate to color.The squirrel is not red.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]100%|##########| 600/600 [3:15:19<00:00,  5.01s/it]100%|##########| 600/600 [3:15:19<00:00, 19.53s/it]

